{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 0, "result": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {"tools": {"listChanged": false}, "resources": {}, "prompts": {}}, "serverInfo": {"name": "ucas", "title": "ucas, a computer algebra system for programmers", "version": "1"}, "instructions": "ucas analyses functions (exhaustively on machine types), does exact algebra and calculus, transforms, number theory and finite fields, and finds cheaper implementations, each answer checked or proved.  Expressions are ucas syntax strings; give parameters types (x: u8, x: f32, x: real) where it matters.  Definitions persist across calls.  An ambiguous input is an error listing its readings: retry with args.assume.KEY.  structuredContent holds the typed result, checks and proof."}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L{x^3 - 3x}(s) = -3(s^2 - 2)/s^4\n  region of convergence: Re(s) > 0\n  one-sided: f(x) for x >= 0 (0 before)\n  rules: linearity, t^n f(t) -> (-1)^n F^(n)(s)\n  check: matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = 1/2, 3/2, 4: max relative difference 1.9e-16\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplace", "ucas": "laplace x^3 - 3x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplace", "region_of_convergence": "Re(s) > 0", "roc": "Re(s) > 0", "one_sided": "f(x) for x >= 0 (0 before)", "rules": "linearity, t^n f(t) -> (-1)^n F^(n)(s)", "lhs": "L{x^3 - 3x}(s)", "value": "-3(s^2 - 2)/s^4", "headline": "L{x^3 - 3x}(s) = -3(s^2 - 2)/s^4"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = 1/2, 3/2, 4: max relative difference 1.9e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "L{x^3 - 3x}(s) = -3(s^2 - 2)/s^4\n  region of convergence: Re(s) > 0\n  one-sided: f(x) for x >= 0 (0 before)\n  rules: linearity, t^n f(t) -> (-1)^n F^(n)(s)\n  check: matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = 1/2, 3/2, 4: max relative difference 1.9e-16\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L{sin(2x)}(s) = 2/(s^2 + 4)\n  region of convergence: Re(s) > 0\n  one-sided: f(x) for x >= 0 (0 before)\n  rules: sin/cos table\n  check: matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = 1/2, 3/2, 4: max relative difference 1.4e-16\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplace", "ucas": "laplace sin(2x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplace", "region_of_convergence": "Re(s) > 0", "roc": "Re(s) > 0", "one_sided": "f(x) for x >= 0 (0 before)", "rules": "sin/cos table", "lhs": "L{sin(2x)}(s)", "value": "2/(s^2 + 4)", "headline": "L{sin(2x)}(s) = 2/(s^2 + 4)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = 1/2, 3/2, 4: max relative difference 1.4e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "L{sin(2x)}(s) = 2/(s^2 + 4)\n  region of convergence: Re(s) > 0\n  one-sided: f(x) for x >= 0 (0 before)\n  rules: sin/cos table\n  check: matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = 1/2, 3/2, 4: max relative difference 1.4e-16\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L{e^(-2x)*cos(3x)}(s) = (s + 2)/(s^2 + 4s + 13)\n  region of convergence: Re(s) > -2\n  one-sided: f(x) for x >= 0 (0 before)\n  rules: e^(at) f(t) -> F(s - a), sin/cos table\n  check: matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = -3/2, -1/2, 2: max relative difference 2.6e-13\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplace", "ucas": "laplace exp(-2x)*cos(3x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplace", "region_of_convergence": "Re(s) > -2", "roc": "Re(s) > -2", "one_sided": "f(x) for x >= 0 (0 before)", "rules": "e^(at) f(t) -> F(s - a), sin/cos table", "lhs": "L{e^(-2x)*cos(3x)}(s)", "value": "(s + 2)/(s^2 + 4s + 13)", "headline": "L{e^(-2x)*cos(3x)}(s) = (s + 2)/(s^2 + 4s + 13)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = -3/2, -1/2, 2: max relative difference 2.6e-13"}], "files": [], "text": "L{e^(-2x)*cos(3x)}(s) = (s + 2)/(s^2 + 4s + 13)\n  region of convergence: Re(s) > -2\n  one-sided: f(x) for x >= 0 (0 before)\n  rules: e^(at) f(t) -> F(s - a), sin/cos table\n  check: matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = -3/2, -1/2, 2: max relative difference 2.6e-13\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L{1}(s) = (1/s - e^(-2s)/s)/(1 - e^(-2s))\n  f is the periodic extension of its values on [0, 2)\n  region of convergence: Re(s) > 0\n  one-sided: f(t) for t >= 0 (0 before)\n  rules: periodic: F(s) = F_T(s)/(1 - e^(-Ts))\n  check: matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = 1/2, 3/2, 4: max relative difference 0\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "laplace", "ucas": "laplace 1 period 2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "laplace", "region_of_convergence": "Re(s) > 0", "roc": "Re(s) > 0", "one_sided": "f(t) for t >= 0 (0 before)", "rules": "periodic: F(s) = F_T(s)/(1 - e^(-Ts))", "lhs": "L{1}(s)", "value": "(1/s - e^(-2s)/s)/(1 - e^(-2s))", "headline": "L{1}(s) = (1/s - e^(-2s)/s)/(1 - e^(-2s))", "details": ["f is the periodic extension of its values on [0, 2)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = 1/2, 3/2, 4: max relative difference 0"}], "files": [], "text": "L{1}(s) = (1/s - e^(-2s)/s)/(1 - e^(-2s))\n  f is the periodic extension of its values on [0, 2)\n  region of convergence: Re(s) > 0\n  one-sided: f(t) for t >= 0 (0 before)\n  rules: periodic: F(s) = F_T(s)/(1 - e^(-Ts))\n  check: matches int_0^inf f(t) e^(-st) dt (Gauss-Kronrod) at s = 1/2, 3/2, 4: max relative difference 0\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L^-1{1/(s^2 + 9)}(t) = sin(3t)/3\n  poles: s = +-3i\n  for t >= 0 (0 before): the right-sided inverse, region of convergence Re(s) > 0 (right of every pole)\n  check: transformed back (Gauss-Kronrod), it matches F at s = 1, 2, 7/2: max relative difference 1.8e-16\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "ilaplace", "ucas": "ilaplace 1/(s^2+9)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "ilaplace", "poles": "s = +-3i", "roc": "Re(s) > 0", "lhs": "L^-1{1/(s^2 + 9)}(t)", "value": "sin(3t)/3", "headline": "L^-1{1/(s^2 + 9)}(t) = sin(3t)/3", "details": ["for t >= 0 (0 before): the right-sided inverse, region of convergence Re(s) > 0 (right of every pole)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "transformed back (Gauss-Kronrod), it matches F at s = 1, 2, 7/2: max relative difference 1.8e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "L^-1{1/(s^2 + 9)}(t) = sin(3t)/3\n  poles: s = +-3i\n  for t >= 0 (0 before): the right-sided inverse, region of convergence Re(s) > 0 (right of every pole)\n  check: transformed back (Gauss-Kronrod), it matches F at s = 1, 2, 7/2: max relative difference 1.8e-16\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 6, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L^-1{1/(s - 1)^3}(t) = t^2*e^t/2\n  poles: s = 1 (triple)\n  for t >= 0 (0 before): the right-sided inverse, region of convergence Re(s) > 1 (right of every pole)\n  check: transformed back (Gauss-Kronrod), it matches F at s = 2, 3, 9/2: max relative difference 1.1e-16\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 6, "ok": true, "cmd": "ilaplace", "ucas": "ilaplace 1/(s-1)^3", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "ilaplace", "poles": "s = 1 (triple)", "roc": "Re(s) > 1", "lhs": "L^-1{1/(s - 1)^3}(t)", "value": "t^2*e^t/2", "headline": "L^-1{1/(s - 1)^3}(t) = t^2*e^t/2", "details": ["for t >= 0 (0 before): the right-sided inverse, region of convergence Re(s) > 1 (right of every pole)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "transformed back (Gauss-Kronrod), it matches F at s = 2, 3, 9/2: max relative difference 1.1e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "L^-1{1/(s - 1)^3}(t) = t^2*e^t/2\n  poles: s = 1 (triple)\n  for t >= 0 (0 before): the right-sided inverse, region of convergence Re(s) > 1 (right of every pole)\n  check: transformed back (Gauss-Kronrod), it matches F at s = 2, 3, 9/2: max relative difference 1.1e-16\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 7, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L^-1{e^(-3s)/(s^2 + 1)}(t) = sin(t - 3)*u(t - 3)\n  poles: s = +-i\n  for t >= 0 (0 before): the right-sided inverse, region of convergence Re(s) > 0 (right of every pole)\n  check: transformed back (Gauss-Kronrod), it matches F at s = 1, 2, 7/2: max relative difference 2.2e-16\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "ilaplace", "ucas": "ilaplace e^(-3s)/(s^2+1)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "ilaplace", "poles": "s = +-i", "roc": "Re(s) > 0", "lhs": "L^-1{e^(-3s)/(s^2 + 1)}(t)", "value": "sin(t - 3)*u(t - 3)", "headline": "L^-1{e^(-3s)/(s^2 + 1)}(t) = sin(t - 3)*u(t - 3)", "details": ["for t >= 0 (0 before): the right-sided inverse, region of convergence Re(s) > 0 (right of every pole)"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "transformed back (Gauss-Kronrod), it matches F at s = 1, 2, 7/2: max relative difference 2.2e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "L^-1{e^(-3s)/(s^2 + 1)}(t) = sin(t - 3)*u(t - 3)\n  poles: s = +-i\n  for t >= 0 (0 before): the right-sided inverse, region of convergence Re(s) > 0 (right of every pole)\n  check: transformed back (Gauss-Kronrod), it matches F at s = 1, 2, 7/2: max relative difference 2.2e-16\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 8, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Z{2^n}(z) = z/(z - 2)\n  in powers of z^-1: 1/(1 - 2z^-1)\n  region of convergence: |z| > 2\n  one-sided: x[n] for n >= 0\n  rules: a^n x[n] -> X(z/a)\n  check: matches sum_n x[n] z^-n (141 terms) at z = 3, 6, 11: max relative difference 4.4e-16\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 8, "ok": true, "cmd": "ztrans", "ucas": "ztrans 2^n", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "ztrans", "in_powers_of_z_1": "1/(1 - 2z^-1)", "region_of_convergence": "|z| > 2", "roc": "|z| > 2", "one_sided": "x[n] for n >= 0", "rules": "a^n x[n] -> X(z/a)", "lhs": "Z{2^n}(z)", "value": "z/(z - 2)", "headline": "Z{2^n}(z) = z/(z - 2)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches sum_n x[n] z^-n (141 terms) at z = 3, 6, 11: max relative difference 4.4e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "Z{2^n}(z) = z/(z - 2)\n  in powers of z^-1: 1/(1 - 2z^-1)\n  region of convergence: |z| > 2\n  one-sided: x[n] for n >= 0\n  rules: a^n x[n] -> X(z/a)\n  check: matches sum_n x[n] z^-n (141 terms) at z = 3, 6, 11: max relative difference 4.4e-16\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 9, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Z{n^2}(z) = (z^2 + z)/(z - 1)^3\n  in powers of z^-1: (z^-1 + z^-2)/(1 - 3z^-1 + 3z^-2 - z^-3)\n  region of convergence: |z| > 1\n  one-sided: x[n] for n >= 0\n  rules: n x[n] -> -z X'(z)\n  check: matches sum_n x[n] z^-n (111 terms) at z = 2, 4, 8: max relative difference 1.5e-16\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 9, "ok": true, "cmd": "ztrans", "ucas": "ztrans n^2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "ztrans", "in_powers_of_z_1": "(z^-1 + z^-2)/(1 - 3z^-1 + 3z^-2 - z^-3)", "region_of_convergence": "|z| > 1", "roc": "|z| > 1", "one_sided": "x[n] for n >= 0", "rules": "n x[n] -> -z X'(z)", "lhs": "Z{n^2}(z)", "value": "(z^2 + z)/(z - 1)^3", "headline": "Z{n^2}(z) = (z^2 + z)/(z - 1)^3"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches sum_n x[n] z^-n (111 terms) at z = 2, 4, 8: max relative difference 1.5e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "Z{n^2}(z) = (z^2 + z)/(z - 1)^3\n  in powers of z^-1: (z^-1 + z^-2)/(1 - 3z^-1 + 3z^-2 - z^-3)\n  region of convergence: |z| > 1\n  one-sided: x[n] for n >= 0\n  rules: n x[n] -> -z X'(z)\n  check: matches sum_n x[n] z^-n (111 terms) at z = 2, 4, 8: max relative difference 1.5e-16\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 10, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Z^-1{z/(z - 2)}[n] = 2^n    for n >= 0\n  poles: z = 2\n  taken as causal (right-sided): region of convergence |z| > 2\n  long division in z^-1: 1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128, ...\n  check: the closed form equals the long division for n = 0..31 (max difference 0)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 10, "ok": true, "cmd": "iztrans", "ucas": "iztrans z/(z-2)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "iztrans", "poles": "z = 2", "taken_as_causal_right_sided": "region of convergence |z| > 2", "roc": "|z| > 2", "long_division_in_z_1": "1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128, ...", "lhs": "Z^-1{z/(z - 2)}[n]", "valid_for": "n >= 0", "value": "2^n", "headline": "Z^-1{z/(z - 2)}[n] = 2^n    for n >= 0"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the closed form equals the long division for n = 0..31 (max difference 0)"}], "files": [], "text": "Z^-1{z/(z - 2)}[n] = 2^n    for n >= 0\n  poles: z = 2\n  taken as causal (right-sided): region of convergence |z| > 2\n  long division in z^-1: 1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128, ...\n  check: the closed form equals the long division for n = 0..31 (max difference 0)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 11, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Z^-1{1/(1 - 1/z)^2}[n] = n + 1    for n >= 0\n  poles: z = 1 (double)\n  taken as causal (right-sided): region of convergence |z| > 1\n  long division in z^-1: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, ...\n  check: the closed form equals the long division for n = 0..31 (max difference 0)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 11, "ok": true, "cmd": "iztrans", "ucas": "iztrans 1/(1-z^-1)^2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "iztrans", "poles": "z = 1 (double)", "taken_as_causal_right_sided": "region of convergence |z| > 1", "roc": "|z| > 1", "long_division_in_z_1": "1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, ...", "lhs": "Z^-1{1/(1 - 1/z)^2}[n]", "valid_for": "n >= 0", "value": "n + 1", "headline": "Z^-1{1/(1 - 1/z)^2}[n] = n + 1    for n >= 0"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the closed form equals the long division for n = 0..31 (max difference 0)"}], "files": [], "text": "Z^-1{1/(1 - 1/z)^2}[n] = n + 1    for n >= 0\n  poles: z = 1 (double)\n  taken as causal (right-sided): region of convergence |z| > 1\n  long division in z^-1: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, ...\n  check: the closed form equals the long division for n = 0..31 (max difference 0)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 12, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "F{e^(-x^2)}(w) = sqrt(pi)*e^(-w^2/4)\n  convention: F(w) = int f(x) e^(-iwx) dx over the real line (angular frequency; the inverse has 1/(2pi))\n  check: matches the integral computed numerically at w = 1/2, 13/10, 27/10: max relative difference 6.7e-16\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 12, "ok": true, "cmd": "fourier", "ucas": "fourier exp(-x^2)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "fourier", "convention": "F(w) = int f(x) e^(-iwx) dx over the real line (angular frequency; the inverse has 1/(2pi))", "lhs": "F{e^(-x^2)}(w)", "value": "sqrt(pi)*e^(-w^2/4)", "headline": "F{e^(-x^2)}(w) = sqrt(pi)*e^(-w^2/4)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches the integral computed numerically at w = 1/2, 13/10, 27/10: max relative difference 6.7e-16"}], "files": [], "text": "F{e^(-x^2)}(w) = sqrt(pi)*e^(-w^2/4)\n  convention: F(w) = int f(x) e^(-iwx) dx over the real line (angular frequency; the inverse has 1/(2pi))\n  check: matches the integral computed numerically at w = 1/2, 13/10, 27/10: max relative difference 6.7e-16\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 13, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "F{1/(x^2 + 4)}(w) = pi*e^(-2abs(w))/2\n  convention: F(w) = int f(x) e^(-iwx) dx over the real line (angular frequency; the inverse has 1/(2pi))\n  check: matches the integral computed numerically at w = 1/2, 13/10, 27/10: max relative difference 1.5e-09\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 13, "ok": true, "cmd": "fourier", "ucas": "fourier 1/(x^2+4)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "fourier", "convention": "F(w) = int f(x) e^(-iwx) dx over the real line (angular frequency; the inverse has 1/(2pi))", "lhs": "F{1/(x^2 + 4)}(w)", "value": "pi*e^(-2abs(w))/2", "headline": "F{1/(x^2 + 4)}(w) = pi*e^(-2abs(w))/2"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches the integral computed numerically at w = 1/2, 13/10, 27/10: max relative difference 1.5e-09"}], "files": [], "text": "F{1/(x^2 + 4)}(w) = pi*e^(-2abs(w))/2\n  convention: F(w) = int f(x) e^(-iwx) dx over the real line (angular frequency; the inverse has 1/(2pi))\n  check: matches the integral computed numerically at w = 1/2, 13/10, 27/10: max relative difference 1.5e-09\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 14, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "F^-1{e^(-abs(w))}(x) = 1/(pi*(x^2 + 1))\n  convention: f(x) = (1/(2pi)) int F(w) e^(iwx) dw\n  check: matches the integral computed numerically at x = 1/2, 13/10, 27/10: max relative difference 1e-14\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 14, "ok": true, "cmd": "ifourier", "ucas": "ifourier exp(-abs(w))", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "ifourier", "convention": "f(x) = (1/(2pi)) int F(w) e^(iwx) dw", "lhs": "F^-1{e^(-abs(w))}(x)", "value": "1/(pi*(x^2 + 1))", "headline": "F^-1{e^(-abs(w))}(x) = 1/(pi*(x^2 + 1))"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "matches the integral computed numerically at x = 1/2, 13/10, 27/10: max relative difference 1e-14"}], "files": [], "text": "F^-1{e^(-abs(w))}(x) = 1/(pi*(x^2 + 1))\n  convention: f(x) = (1/(2pi)) int F(w) e^(iwx) dw\n  check: matches the integral computed numerically at x = 1/2, 13/10, 27/10: max relative difference 1e-14\n"}, "isError": false}}
