{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 19, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "DFT of 4 values (X[k] = sum_n x[n] e^(-2 pi i k n/N); radix-2 FFT, N log2 N operations)\n  k    X[k]                         |.|            arg\n  0    10                           10             0\n  1    -2 + 2i                      2sqrt(2)       3pi/4\n  2    -2                           2              pi\n  3    -2 - 2i                      2sqrt(2)       -3pi/4\n  check: the inverse transform gives the input back (max difference 0); Parseval: sum |x|^2 = 30, sum |X|^2/N = 30\n  bin k is the frequency k/N cycles per sample; k > N/2 are the negative frequencies k - N\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 19, "ok": true, "cmd": "dft", "ucas": "dft [1, 2, 3, 4]", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "dft", "n": 4, "values": [{"exact": "10", "re": 10, "im": 0, "abs": 10, "arg": 0}, {"exact": "-2 + 2i", "re": -2, "im": 2, "abs": 2.8284271247461903, "arg": 2.356194490192345}, {"exact": "-2", "re": -2, "im": 0, "abs": 2, "arg": 3.141592653589793}, {"exact": "-2 - 2i", "re": -1.9999999999999998, "im": -2, "abs": 2.82842712474619, "arg": -2.356194490192345}], "headline": "DFT of 4 values (X[k] = sum_n x[n] e^(-2 pi i k n/N); radix-2 FFT, N log2 N operations)", "details": ["k    X[k]                         |.|            arg", "0    10                           10             0", "1    -2 + 2i                      2sqrt(2)       3pi/4", "2    -2                           2              pi", "3    -2 - 2i                      2sqrt(2)       -3pi/4", "bin k is the frequency k/N cycles per sample; k > N/2 are the negative frequencies k - N"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the inverse transform gives the input back (max difference 0); Parseval: sum |x|^2 = 30, sum |X|^2/N = 30"}], "files": [], "text": "DFT of 4 values (X[k] = sum_n x[n] e^(-2 pi i k n/N); radix-2 FFT, N log2 N operations)\n  k    X[k]                         |.|            arg\