{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 21, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "sum(n, 1, inf, 1/n^2)\n  converges absolutely: p-series 1/n^2 with p = 2 > 1\n  = pi^2/6\n  method: partial fractions; zeta(k), digamma at integers\n  numeric: 1.644934066848226 (the first 128 terms plus an Euler-Maclaurin tail (integral + 3 corrections); estimated error 4.4e-16)\n  check: the closed form and the numeric value agree (difference 4.4e-16)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 21, "ok": true, "cmd": "infinite_sum", "ucas": "sum(n, 1, inf, 1/n^2)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "infinite_sum", "converges_absolutely": "p-series 1/n^2 with p = 2 > 1", "value": "pi^2/6", "method": "partial fractions; zeta(k), digamma at integers", "numeric": "1.644934066848226 (the first 128 terms plus an Euler-Maclaurin tail (integral + 3 corrections); estimated error 4.4e-16)", "headline": "sum(n, 1, inf, 1/n^2)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the closed form and the numeric value agree (difference 4.4e-16)"}], "files": [], "text": "sum(n, 1, inf, 1/n^2)\n  converges absolutely: p-series 1/n^2 with p = 2 > 1\n  = pi^2/6\n  method: partial fractions; zeta(k), digamma at integers\n  numeric: 1.644934066848226 (the first 128 terms plus an Euler-Maclaurin tail (integral + 3 corrections); estimated error 4.4e-16)\n  check: the closed form and the numeric value agree (difference 4.4e-16)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 22, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "sum(n, 1, inf, (-1)^n/n)\n  converges conditionally: alternating series test (|a_n| decreases to 0); not absolutely: |a_n| ~ C/n (p <= 1)\n  = -log(2)\n  method: partial fractions; eta(k) = (1 - 2^(1-k)) zeta(k), Dirichlet beta\n  numeric: -0.6931471805599452 (alternating: Cohen-Villegas-Zagier acceleration (an Euler-type transform), 40 terms; estimated error 1.1e-16)\n  check: the closed form and the numeric value agree (difference 1.1e-16)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 22, "ok": true, "cmd": "infinite_sum", "ucas": "sum(n, 1, inf, (-1)^n/n)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "infinite_sum", "converges_conditionally": "alternating series test (|a_n| decreases to 0); not absolutely: |a_n| ~ C/n (p <= 1)", "value": "-log(2)", "method": "partial fractions; eta(k) = (1 - 2^(1-k)) zeta(k), Dirichlet beta", "numeric": "-0.6931471805599452 (alternating: Cohen-Villegas-Zagier acceleration (an Euler-type transform), 40 terms; estimated error 1.1e-16)", "headline": "sum(n, 1, inf, (-1)^n/n)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the closed form and the numeric value agree (difference 1.1e-16)"}], "files": [], "text": "sum(n, 1, inf, (-1)^n/n)\n  converges conditionally: alternating series test (|a_n| decreases to 0); not absolutely: |a_n| ~ C/n (p <= 1)\n  = -log(2)\n  method: partial fractions; eta(k) = (1 - 2^(1-k)) zeta(k), Dirichlet beta\n  numeric: -0.6931471805599452 (alternating: Cohen-Villegas-Zagier acceleration (an Euler-type transform), 40 terms; estimated error 1.1e-16)\n  check: the closed form and the numeric value agree (difference 1.1e-16)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 23, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "prod(n, 1, inf, 1/n^2 + 1)\n  converges: the factors are 1 + O(1/n^2) (sum |a_n - 1| converges)\n  = sinh(pi)/pi\n  method: the factors as (n - a_i)/(n - b_i): prod Gamma(1 - b_i)/Gamma(1 - a_i)\n  numeric: 3.67607791008984 (partial products to 4096, Richardson in 1/N twice; estimated error 4.4e-07)\n  check: agree (difference 2.9e-10)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 23, "ok": true, "cmd": "infinite_product", "ucas": "prod(n, 1, inf, 1+1/n^2)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "infinite_product", "converges": "the factors are 1 + O(1/n^2) (sum |a_n - 1| converges)", "value": "sinh(pi)/pi", "method": "the factors as (n - a_i)/(n - b_i): prod Gamma(1 - b_i)/Gamma(1 - a_i)", "numeric": "3.67607791008984 (partial products to 4096, Richardson in 1/N twice; estimated error 4.4e-07)", "headline": "prod(n, 1, inf, 1/n^2 + 1)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "agree (difference 2.9e-10)"}], "files": [], "text": "prod(n, 1, inf, 1/n^2 + 1)\n  converges: the factors are 1 + O(1/n^2) (sum |a_n - 1| converges)\n  = sinh(pi)/pi\n  method: the factors as (n - a_i)/(n - b_i): prod Gamma(1 - b_i)/Gamma(1 - a_i)\n  numeric: 3.67607791008984 (partial products to 4096, Richardson in 1/N twice; estimated error 4.4e-07)\n  check: agree (difference 2.9e-10)\n"}, "isError": false}}
