{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 26, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "power series sum(n, 1, inf, x^n/n) in x\n  center x = 0; coefficients a_n = 1/n of x^(n)\n  radius of convergence R = 1 (ratio test: |a_(n+1)/a_n| -> 1)\n  at x = -1: converges conditionally (alternating series test (|a_n| decreases to 0); not absolutely: |a_n| ~ C/n (p <= 1))\n  at x = 1: diverges (limit comparison with the harmonic series sum 1/n (p = 1): a_n n -> 1)\n  interval of convergence: [-1, 1)\n  sum = -log(1 - x)    for |x| < 1 (-log(1 - u))\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 26, "ok": true, "cmd": "radius", "ucas": "radius x^n/n", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "radius", "radius": {"value": 1, "exact": "1"}, "center": {"value": 0, "exact": "0"}, "coefficient": "1/n", "test": "ratio test", "interval_of_convergence": "[-1, 1)", "sum": {"value": "-log(1 - x)", "valid_for": "|x| < 1 (-log(1 - u))"}, "headline": "power series sum(n, 1, inf, x^n/n) in x", "details": ["center x = 0; coefficients a_n = 1/n of x^(n)", "radius of convergence R = 1 (ratio test: |a_(n+1)/a_n| -> 1)", "at x = -1: converges conditionally (alternating series test (|a_n| decreases to 0); not absolutely: |a_n| ~ C/n (p <= 1))", "at x = 1: diverges (limit comparison with the harmonic series sum 1/n (p = 1): a_n n -> 1)"]}, "results": [{"kind": "radius"}, {"kind": "radius", "radius": {"value": 1, "exact": "1"}, "center": {"value": 0, "exact": "0"}, "coefficient": "1/n", "test": "ratio test", "interval_of_convergence": "[-1, 1)", "sum": {"value": "-log(1 - x)", "valid_for": "|x| < 1 (-log(1 - u))"}, "headline": "power series sum(n, 1, inf, x^n/n) in x", "details": ["center x = 0; coefficients a_n = 1/n of x^(n)", "radius of convergence R = 1 (ratio test: |a_(n+1)/a_n| -> 1)", "at x = -1: converges conditionally (alternating series test (|a_n| decreases to 0); not absolutely: |a_n| ~ C/n (p <= 1))", "at x = 1: diverges (limit comparison with the harmonic series sum 1/n (p = 1): a_n n -> 1)"]}], "notes": [],